---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Cyprus Student Guide';
const description = 'Official Privacy Policy for CyprusStudentGuide.com. Outlines data protection, cookie usage, Google AdSense compliance, and GDPR protocols.';
const permalink = 'https://cyprusstudentguide.com/privacy/';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} permalink={permalink} current="privacy">
  <div class="legal-container">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <span class="badge">GDPR & COMPLIANCE</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Overview & Data Controller</h2>
        <p>At <strong>CyprusStudentGuide.com</strong>, the privacy of our visitors is of paramount importance. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of personal and technical information collected and recorded by our platform and how we utilize it in accordance with the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>CyprusStudentGuide.com is an open-access informational publication. We do not require mandatory user account registration to read our guides. We collect minimal data solely for security, performance optimization, and anonymous analytics:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Log Files:</strong> Like standard web servers, our host collects non-personally identifiable log files including Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), referring/exit pages, and date/time stamps.</li>
          <li><strong>Communication Data:</strong> If you contact us directly at <code>contact@cyprusstudentguide.com</code>, we receive your email address and message contents strictly to answer your inquiry.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
        <p>We use essential cookies and browser <code>localStorage</code> purely to remember your UI preferences (such as Light/Dark mode state and your selected language translation preference). These technical entries contain zero personally identifiable tracking data.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising</h2>
        <p>CyprusStudentGuide.com works with advertising partners such as Google AdSense. Third-party ad vendors, including Google, use cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie) to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the internet:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
          <li>Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Your GDPR Data Rights</h2>
        <p>Under GDPR regulations, every user is entitled to data transparency rights, including the right to request access, rectification, or erasure of any personal email communications held by us. To exercise any of these rights, please contact our data desk at: <a href="mailto:contact@cyprusstudentguide.com">contact@cyprusstudentguide.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem 4rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }

  .badge {
    background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>
